+BUCKET2_EXTRA="--skip-npy --skip-dists --kmeans-train-fraction 0.10 --cache-mb 15000 --bucket-mem-mb 16000 --gpu-bucket-cache-mb 10240"   # #22: 10 GB; #21: Step 6 GPU bucket cache 2 → 8 GB (Step 6 itself uses ~4 GB of the 16 GB V100; the 14.6 GB peak is in an earlier step); #9: Step 6 host Belady cache holds a whole SIFT100M round (13.6 GB of records; default cpu_limit/2 = 8.6 GB); #14: round 2..t records stay in RAM (no BucketWrite to disk), Step 6 copies misses from them
